{"symbol":"OPM.WA","area":"poland","updated":"2026-11-09T19:55:14Z","info":{"address1":"Tajecina 113","city":"Jasionka","zip":"36-002","country":"Poland","phone":"48 17 867 2100","fax":"48 17 852 0138","website":"https://www.opteam.pl","industry":"Information Technology Services","industryKey":"information-technology-services","industryDisp":"Information Technology Services","sector":"Technology","sectorKey":"technology","sectorDisp":"Technology","longBusinessSummary":"OPTeam Spólka Akcyjna provides IT solutions for businesses, public institutions, and universities in Poland. The company offers higher education solutions, such as electronic academic service platform EDU web360; ERP systems, including FK, KP, sales, logistics, fixed assets, WMS, BI; Multiportal Web360; implementation of the USOS dean's office system; digitization of university processes and document flows; Multiportal Public Web360; OPTIpass; Multiportal EDU Web360; OPTIcamp; and universal IT solutions. The company also offers activities related to IT consultancy; activities related to the management of IT devices; software-related activities, including analysis, design and programming of systems; data processing, website management (hosting) and similar activities; wholesale of computers, fiscal devices, peripherals and software; execution of electrical installations and other building installations; repair and maintenance of computers and peripherals, telecommunications equipment; and extracurricular forms of education. The company was formerly known as Optimus-Comfort Sp. z o.o. and changed its name to OPTeam Spólka Akcyjna in May 2003. OPTeam Spólka Akcyjna was founded in 1988 and is headquartered in Jasionka, Poland.","fullTimeEmployees":160,"companyOfficers":[{"maxAge":1,"name":"Mr. Tomasz  Ostrowski","title":"President of the Management Board","exercisedValue":0,"unexercisedValue":0},{"maxAge":1,"name":"Mr. Jacek  Blahut","title":"Vice-President of the Management Board","exercisedValue":0,"une